{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21545","headline":"使东川 江楼月 · 元稹","name":"使东川 江楼月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉陵江岸驿楼中，江在楼前月在空。\n月色满牀兼满地，江声如鼓复如风。\n诚知远近皆三五，但恐阴晴有异同。\n万一帝乡还洁白，几人潜傍杏园东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}